## Agent Responsibilities

ANY agent implementing forecast/accuracy features MUST:
- Store ALL predictions with timestamps + evidence
- Implement outcome measurement (automated where possible)
- Calculate Brier scores for resolved forecasts
- Expose accuracy metrics to users (don't hide track record)
- Never delete forecasts (append-only, full auditability)
